Two main characteristics that describe the entire game:
- Unbridled Action: In Just Cause you can do everything you imagine, like jumping off airplanes in flight, killing some soldiers while in the air with the parachute, than fall on the roof of a car, steal it and go running over the enemy army;
- Characters / cliché story: If you are expecting a good story, this is not the game for you! What saves the game is the insanely fun gameplay. The characters are a hot blonde, a Latin badass and americans intervening in other people's governments.

And I got to say, one of the best survival games out there. Story is kinda meh (
